ắt) ↔ \"cheap\" (rẻ).","lessonId":"u9n5l1","lessonVersion":"v2.u9n5l1","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u9n5","order":68,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u9n5l1","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec2","signature":"-cm73G08jEvKtuuaSzi780s-kCrJ7NtInm6PBomtXMDhB7Eff_gGkgdjcU3xv8EgLNUUSJVFcNcBX9vuY6cIAw","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["u9.vocab","u9.grammar","listening"],"title":"Trả tiền · Bài 1","unitId":"u9"}